{
  "schema": "lean-proof-simplification-evidence-v1",
  "source_commit": "fe1c5fbc88c33cecd501058ed36571039bc8afe8",
  "scope": "Deferred local annotated tag dispatch proof experiments; no candidate adopted",
  "validation": "Three isolated variants and paired seven-module chains passed; v2 changes two old generated proof types, while v3 preserves old reports, adds two generated names, and has matching global simp and instances.",
  "limitations": [
    "The direct grouped v2 changes two existing generated public proof types.",
    "The v3 variant adds two generated public reassociation proofs; no extra global simp registrations were observed.",
    "Single target timing pairs are small shared-load samples and do not establish a performance result.",
    "The v3 change saves only six lines across two files, while additional reassociation obscures the original per-tag check mapping; it was deferred.",
    "Only recorded project provider objects were source-matched; broader transitive providers remain cached.",
    "No compiled object files are included in the archive; object equality is documented by build receipts and observed at experiment time."
  ],
